.png", "id": "920856615987670", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75289916_920856619321003_1167628786352568211_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Oe3Yu6wvkksQ7kNvwHxWSU8&_nc_oc=AdmGck1Z4TETZ9FjxzMjxWcEAuP4K-NPUosSqELWIheITT2tr0fl_plPM3MAO4Uw1LY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwPUV5HQhNSmY0TQqkZ_QfdYLAO2W8GhQF7tgK6Kynh0g&oe=69BAA518"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 5_2560_1440.png", "id": "727856879468758", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974812_727856882802091_1641997799950234504_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jRVipc-YtecQ7kNvwHnASeS&_nc_oc=AdmfToW_55t4_uVmC7S1oWUS5Iz2bR10bG5eQCcHewJlZfSDHhM-_X5o8dLg46RP90w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxNWO0oAtCK4UMpP0ysbMNgBkjNZY6V-6c4lzMmV7qe_Q&oe=69BAA240"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt_Galateum_CoverLandscape.png", "id": "684438640283334", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974677_684438646950000_5562717609088558112_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SeEaYC6uwQoQ7kNvwHtJvp7&_nc_oc=AdlGgNBjyoKaq3M_yxQEwx8wjau1G7MhBHvY4DjTgZb_w5n0hkQR3-P4XVwQQaJZbdE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzAC1lziM5izBErGHBCWx6m6m-P7BuIZsQCGT7xAgmlIQ&oe=69BAA273"}, "display_name": "Galateum", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Immerse yourself in our unique FPS experience, combining cyberpunk aesthetics with the merciless conditions of a desert planet. Navigate neon-lit buildings and desolate vistas, outmoving and outplaying your opponents.\nCombat isn't just about force - it's about strategy and adaptation. Leverage the jet-pack to traverse the environment, using the map's entire verticality, while engaging in intense gun fights.\nYour cyberpunk survival odyssey starts here.\n\n", "short_description": "Dive into a unique FPS experience on a harsh desert planet. Challenge yourself and other p